<!--
  Final pick-loop navigate-to-pose tree: shuttles forever between the
  externally-requested goal ("target") and the origin (0,0).

  Root structure:
    Sequence "CaptureTargetThenShuttleForever"
      1. SetBlackboard - runs ONCE, before the loop: snapshots whatever
         PoseStamped the NavigateToPose action client originally sent into
         {target_goal}, so it survives being overwritten every time the
         "return to origin" leg rewrites {goal} to (0,0).
      2. FixedPickObject - runs ONCE, before the loop: bootstrap pick so the
         very first "GoToTarget" leg below has something to place. Without
         this, cycle 1 would place with an empty gripper - the "place first"
         shape only makes sense once the shuttle already carries something.
      3. Repeat num_cycles="-1" "ShuttleForever" - re-ticks its child forever.
         Each cycle is one full round trip, place-then-pick at BOTH stops:
           a. "GoToTarget": restore {goal} from {target_goal} via
              SetBlackboard, NavigateRecovery to {goal} (now = target), then
              PlaceObject (drop what it's carrying) followed by
              FixedPickObject (pick up the next item, same spot).
           b. "ReturnToOrigin": overwrite {goal} to (0,0) via SetFixedGoal,
              NavigateRecovery to {goal} (now = origin), then PlaceObject
              followed by FixedPickObject - same place-then-pick shape as
              the target leg.

  IMPORTANT CAVEAT (behaviortree_cpp_v3, which is what Nav2 Humble uses):
  RepeatNode does NOT keep looping through failures the way v4's does. Per
  its own header comment: "If the child returns FAILURE, the loop is
  stopped and this node returns FAILURE." So if the bootstrap
  FixedPickObject, PlaceObject, a per-leg FixedPickObject, or either
  NavigateRecovery exhausts its 6 retries, the ENTIRE shuttle stops (root
  returns FAILURE) instead of just skipping to the next round trip. If you
  want the shuttle to survive a failed leg and keep going forever
  regardless, wrap "RoundTrip" below in <ForceSuccess> before it reaches
  Repeat - not done here since that was flagged, not requested yet.

  Because the root never returns SUCCESS while shuttling, the
  NavigateToPose action this tree backs never completes/reports a result to
  its action client - expected for a "run forever" mission, not a
  single request/response nav call.

  NavigateRecovery (duplicated once per leg, identical apart from the name
  labels - the existing navigate-to-pose tree with replanning and recovery,
  plus the movable-obstacle branch below):
    * CaptureInitialPath latches the FIRST global path for the goal.
    * The green-box nodes drive to a standoff in front of the box and stop.
    * WaitForObstacleClearance holds there until /obstacle/still_present is
      false (or 10 s pass), then the costmaps are wiped and the robot
      resumes {initial_path}.

  MOVABLE-OBSTACLE HANDLING (one copy per leg - ToTarget and ToOrigin each
  get their own HandleMovableObstacle branch):
    * Perception is the green_box_approach package's detector_node (HSV +
      /scan, no VLM): it publishes green_box/pose (PoseStamped, map frame,
      box centre) and green_box/detected (Bool, true once confirmed over
      consecutive frames). It must be running alongside Nav2
      (ros2 launch green_box_approach green_box_approach.launch.py), and its
      output_frame must match global_frame="map" below.
    * CaptureInitialPath latches the FIRST global path for the current leg's
      goal (re-latches whenever the goal moves > 0.5 m, so ToTarget and
      ToOrigin - and each new cycle of the shuttle - each get their own fresh
      capture).
    * IsGreenBoxDetected gates the branch: green_box/detected is true AND
      green_box/pose is no older than 1 s.
    * ComputeGreenBoxApproachGoal turns the box pose into {approach_goal},
      0.8 m short of the box centre along robot->box, facing it (holds the
      current pose if the robot is already inside 0.8 m).
    * ComputePathToPose plans {approach_path} to it (one global-costmap
      clear + retry on failure).
    * ApproachThenResume: FollowPath to the standoff point, then
      FinalApproachStop turns to the box and creeps in open-loop on /cmd_vel
      (bypassing the costmap), stopping at 0.55 m robot-to-box-centre or
      0.4 m forward /scan range - whichever fires first. Then PlaceObject
      (set down whatever it's carrying so the arm is free), PushObstacle
      (extend the arm to the push pose and HOLD it there - posture only, no
      base motion; this does NOT physically move the obstacle by itself),
      FixedPickObject (pick the carried item back up), then
      WaitForObstacleClearance holds the robot there - motionless - until
      /obstacle/still_present goes false or 10 s pass; then both costmaps
      are wiped and the robot resumes {initial_path} to the original goal.
    * WaitForObstacleClearance timeout="10.0" is a stopgap: nothing publishes
      /obstacle/still_present yet, and with timeout 0 the wait never ends
      when no message ever arrives (clear_on_stale only applies after a
      first message). TODO: have the arm side publish a clearance event on
      that topic (false = cleared); the 10 s timeout then only backs it up.
      green_box/detected is not usable for this - at contact range the
      detector rejects the clipped blob and reports false with the box still
      in place.
    * FinalApproachStop's 0.55 m / ComputeGreenBoxApproachGoal's 0.8 m assume
      a ~0.3 m box - re-set them for the real box (see green_box_approach
      README).
    * If IsGreenBoxDetected fails (no confirmed box in view),
      ReactiveFallback drops straight through to the plain FollowPath on
      {path}.
-->
<root main_tree_to_execute="MainTree">
  <BehaviorTree ID="MainTree">
    <Sequence name="CaptureTargetThenShuttleForever">

      <SetBlackboard value="{goal}" output_key="target_goal"/>

      <FixedPickObject arm_action_name="/arm_controller/follow_joint_trajectory"
                       gripper_action_name="/gripper_controller/gripper_cmd"
                       arm_joint_names="joint1;joint2;joint3;joint4"
                       arm_move_time="3.0"
                       open_position="0.02501155674647538"
                       grasp_position="0.002"
                       max_effort="0.0002"
                       server_timeout="5.0"
                       step_timeout="15.0"/>

      <Repeat num_cycles="-1" name="ShuttleForever">
        <Sequence name="RoundTrip">

          <Sequence name="GoToTarget">
            <SetBlackboard value="{target_goal}" output_key="goal"/>

            <RecoveryNode number_of_retries="6" name="NavigateToTargetRecovery">
              <PipelineSequence name="NavigateToTargetWithReplanning">
                <RateController hz="1.0">
                  <RecoveryNode number_of_retries="1" name="ComputePathToTarget">
                    <Timeout msec="3000">
                      <ComputePathToPose goal="{goal}" path="{path}" planner_id="GridBased"/>
                    </Timeout>
                    <ClearEntireCostmap name="ClearGlobalCostmap-Context-ToTarget" service_name="global_costmap/clear_entirely_global_costmap"/>
                  </RecoveryNode>
                </RateController>
                <RecoveryNode number_of_retries="1" name="FollowPathToTarget">
                  <ReactiveFallback name="FollowPathOrHandleMovableObstacle-ToTarget">
                    <Sequence name="HandleMovableObstacle-ToTarget">
                      <CaptureInitialPath path="{path}" goal="{goal}"
                                          goal_change_threshold="0.5"
                                          initial_path="{initial_path}"/>
                      <IsGreenBoxDetected pose_topic="green_box/pose"
                                          visible_topic="green_box/detected"
                                          max_age="1.0"/>
                      <ComputeGreenBoxApproachGoal pose_topic="green_box/pose"
                                                   global_frame="map"
                                                   robot_base_frame="base_link"
                                                   standoff_distance="0.8"
                                                   max_age="1.0"
                                                   approach_goal="{approach_goal}"/>
                      <RecoveryNode number_of_retries="1" name="ComputePathToGreenBox-ToTarget">
                        <ComputePathToPose goal="{approach_goal}" path="{approach_path}" planner_id="GridBased"/>
                        <ClearEntireCostmap name="ClearGlobalCostmap-GreenBox-ToTarget" service_name="global_costmap/clear_entirely_global_costmap"/>
                      </RecoveryNode>
                      <Sequence name="ApproachThenResume-ToTarget">
                        <FollowPath path="{approach_path}" controller_id="FollowPath"/>
                        <FinalApproachStop scan_topic="/scan"
                                           cmd_vel_topic="/cmd_vel"
                                           stop_distance="0.4"
                                           approach_speed="0.15"
                                           front_half_angle="0.26"
                                           scan_loss_timeout="0.5"
                                           time_allowance="30.0"
                                           pose_topic="green_box/pose"
                                           global_frame="map"
                                           robot_base_frame="base_link"
                                           stop_center_distance="0.55"/>

                        <PlaceObject arm_action_name="/arm_controller/follow_joint_trajectory"
                                     gripper_action_name="/gripper_controller/gripper_cmd"
                                     arm_joint_names="joint1;joint2;joint3;joint4"
                                     arm_move_time="3.0"
                                     open_position="0.02501155674647538"
                                     max_effort="0.0002"
                                     server_timeout="5.0"
                                     step_timeout="15.0"
                                     post_open_delay="1.0"/>

                        <PushObstacle arm_action_name="/arm_controller/follow_joint_trajectory"
                                      gripper_action_name="/gripper_controller/gripper_cmd"
                                      arm_joint_names="joint1;joint2;joint3;joint4"
                                      arm_move_time="3.0"
                                      open_position="0.02501155674647538"
                                      max_effort="0.0"
                                      push_hold_time="1.0"
                                      server_timeout="5.0"
                                      step_timeout="15.0"/>

                        <FixedPickObject arm_action_name="/arm_controller/follow_joint_trajectory"
                                         gripper_action_name="/gripper_controller/gripper_cmd"
                                         arm_joint_names="joint1;joint2;joint3;joint4"
                                         arm_move_time="3.0"
                                         open_position="0.02501155674647538"
                                         grasp_position="0.002"
                                         max_effort="0.0002"
                                         server_timeout="5.0"
                                         step_timeout="15.0"/>

                        <WaitForObstacleClearance topic="/obstacle/still_present"
                                                  timeout="10.0"
                                                  clear_on_stale="true"
                                                  message_timeout="3.0"/>
                        <ClearEntireCostmap name="ClearLocalCostmap-Resume-ToTarget"
                                            service_name="local_costmap/clear_entirely_local_costmap"/>
                        <ClearEntireCostmap name="ClearGlobalCostmap-Resume-ToTarget"
                                            service_name="global_costmap/clear_entirely_global_costmap"/>
                        <FollowPath path="{initial_path}" controller_id="FollowPath"/>
                      </Sequence>
                    </Sequence>
                    <FollowPath path="{path}" controller_id="FollowPath" goal_checker_id="general_goal_checker"/>
                  </ReactiveFallback>
                  <ClearEntireCostmap name="ClearLocalCostmap-Context-ToTarget" service_name="local_costmap/clear_entirely_local_costmap"/>
                </RecoveryNode>
              </PipelineSequence>
              <ReactiveFallback name="RecoveryFallback-ToTarget">
                <GoalUpdated/>
                <RoundRobin name="RecoveryActions-ToTarget">
                  <Sequence name="ClearingActions-ToTarget">
                    <ClearEntireCostmap name="ClearLocalCostmap-Subtree-ToTarget" service_name="local_costmap/clear_entirely_local_costmap"/>
                    <ClearEntireCostmap name="ClearGlobalCostmap-Subtree-ToTarget" service_name="global_costmap/clear_entirely_global_costmap"/>
                  </Sequence>
                  <Spin spin_dist="3.14"/>
                  <Wait wait_duration="5"/>
                  <BackUp backup_dist="0.30" backup_speed="0.05"/>
                </RoundRobin>
              </ReactiveFallback>
            </RecoveryNode>

            <PlaceObject arm_action_name="/arm_controller/follow_joint_trajectory"
                         gripper_action_name="/gripper_controller/gripper_cmd"
                         arm_joint_names="joint1;joint2;joint3;joint4"
                         arm_move_time="3.0"
                         open_position="0.02501155674647538"
                         max_effort="0.0002"
                         server_timeout="5.0"
                         step_timeout="15.0"
                         post_open_delay="1.0"/>

            <FixedPickObject arm_action_name="/arm_controller/follow_joint_trajectory"
                             gripper_action_name="/gripper_controller/gripper_cmd"
                             arm_joint_names="joint1;joint2;joint3;joint4"
                             arm_move_time="3.0"
                             open_position="0.02501155674647538"
                             grasp_position="0.002"
                             max_effort="0.0002"
                             server_timeout="5.0"
                             step_timeout="15.0"/>
          </Sequence>

          <Sequence name="ReturnToOrigin">
            <SetFixedGoal x="0.0" y="0.0" yaw="0.0" frame="map" goal="{goal}"/>

            <RecoveryNode number_of_retries="6" name="NavigateToOriginRecovery">
              <PipelineSequence name="NavigateToOriginWithReplanning">
                <RateController hz="1.0">
                  <RecoveryNode number_of_retries="1" name="ComputePathToOrigin">
                    <Timeout msec="3000">
                      <ComputePathToPose goal="{goal}" path="{path}" planner_id="GridBased"/>
                    </Timeout>
                    <ClearEntireCostmap name="ClearGlobalCostmap-Context-ToOrigin" service_name="global_costmap/clear_entirely_global_costmap"/>
                  </RecoveryNode>
                </RateController>
                <RecoveryNode number_of_retries="1" name="FollowPathToOrigin">
                  <ReactiveFallback name="FollowPathOrHandleMovableObstacle-ToOrigin">
                    <Sequence name="HandleMovableObstacle-ToOrigin">
                      <CaptureInitialPath path="{path}" goal="{goal}"
                                          goal_change_threshold="0.5"
                                          initial_path="{initial_path}"/>
                      <IsGreenBoxDetected pose_topic="green_box/pose"
                                          visible_topic="green_box/detected"
                                          max_age="1.0"/>
                      <ComputeGreenBoxApproachGoal pose_topic="green_box/pose"
                                                   global_frame="map"
                                                   robot_base_frame="base_link"
                                                   standoff_distance="0.8"
                                                   max_age="1.0"
                                                   approach_goal="{approach_goal}"/>
                      <RecoveryNode number_of_retries="1" name="ComputePathToGreenBox-ToOrigin">
                        <ComputePathToPose goal="{approach_goal}" path="{approach_path}" planner_id="GridBased"/>
                        <ClearEntireCostmap name="ClearGlobalCostmap-GreenBox-ToOrigin" service_name="global_costmap/clear_entirely_global_costmap"/>
                      </RecoveryNode>
                      <Sequence name="ApproachThenResume-ToOrigin">
                        <FollowPath path="{approach_path}" controller_id="FollowPath"/>
                        <FinalApproachStop scan_topic="/scan"
                                           cmd_vel_topic="/cmd_vel"
                                           stop_distance="0.4"
                                           approach_speed="0.15"
                                           front_half_angle="0.26"
                                           scan_loss_timeout="0.5"
                                           time_allowance="30.0"
                                           pose_topic="green_box/pose"
                                           global_frame="map"
                                           robot_base_frame="base_link"
                                           stop_center_distance="0.55"/>

                        <PlaceObject arm_action_name="/arm_controller/follow_joint_trajectory"
                                     gripper_action_name="/gripper_controller/gripper_cmd"
                                     arm_joint_names="joint1;joint2;joint3;joint4"
                                     arm_move_time="3.0"
                                     open_position="0.02501155674647538"
                                     max_effort="0.0002"
                                     server_timeout="5.0"
                                     step_timeout="15.0"
                                     post_open_delay="1.0"/>

                        <PushObstacle arm_action_name="/arm_controller/follow_joint_trajectory"
                                      gripper_action_name="/gripper_controller/gripper_cmd"
                                      arm_joint_names="joint1;joint2;joint3;joint4"
                                      arm_move_time="3.0"
                                      open_position="0.02501155674647538"
                                      max_effort="0.0"
                                      push_hold_time="1.0"
                                      server_timeout="5.0"
                                      step_timeout="15.0"/>

                        <FixedPickObject arm_action_name="/arm_controller/follow_joint_trajectory"
                                         gripper_action_name="/gripper_controller/gripper_cmd"
                                         arm_joint_names="joint1;joint2;joint3;joint4"
                                         arm_move_time="3.0"
                                         open_position="0.02501155674647538"
                                         grasp_position="0.002"
                                         max_effort="0.0002"
                                         server_timeout="5.0"
                                         step_timeout="15.0"/>

                        <WaitForObstacleClearance topic="/obstacle/still_present"
                                                  timeout="10.0"
                                                  clear_on_stale="true"
                                                  message_timeout="3.0"/>
                        <ClearEntireCostmap name="ClearLocalCostmap-Resume-ToOrigin"
                                            service_name="local_costmap/clear_entirely_local_costmap"/>
                        <ClearEntireCostmap name="ClearGlobalCostmap-Resume-ToOrigin"
                                            service_name="global_costmap/clear_entirely_global_costmap"/>
                        <FollowPath path="{initial_path}" controller_id="FollowPath"/>
                      </Sequence>
                    </Sequence>
                    <FollowPath path="{path}" controller_id="FollowPath" goal_checker_id="general_goal_checker"/>
                  </ReactiveFallback>
                  <ClearEntireCostmap name="ClearLocalCostmap-Context-ToOrigin" service_name="local_costmap/clear_entirely_local_costmap"/>
                </RecoveryNode>
              </PipelineSequence>
              <ReactiveFallback name="RecoveryFallback-ToOrigin">
                <GoalUpdated/>
                <RoundRobin name="RecoveryActions-ToOrigin">
                  <Sequence name="ClearingActions-ToOrigin">
                    <ClearEntireCostmap name="ClearLocalCostmap-Subtree-ToOrigin" service_name="local_costmap/clear_entirely_local_costmap"/>
                    <ClearEntireCostmap name="ClearGlobalCostmap-Subtree-ToOrigin" service_name="global_costmap/clear_entirely_global_costmap"/>
                  </Sequence>
                  <Spin spin_dist="3.14"/>
                  <Wait wait_duration="5"/>
                  <BackUp backup_dist="0.30" backup_speed="0.05"/>
                </RoundRobin>
              </ReactiveFallback>
            </RecoveryNode>

            <PlaceObject arm_action_name="/arm_controller/follow_joint_trajectory"
                         gripper_action_name="/gripper_controller/gripper_cmd"
                         arm_joint_names="joint1;joint2;joint3;joint4"
                         arm_move_time="3.0"
                         open_position="0.02501155674647538"
                         max_effort="0.0002"
                         server_timeout="5.0"
                         step_timeout="15.0"
                         post_open_delay="1.0"/>

            <FixedPickObject arm_action_name="/arm_controller/follow_joint_trajectory"
                             gripper_action_name="/gripper_controller/gripper_cmd"
                             arm_joint_names="joint1;joint2;joint3;joint4"
                             arm_move_time="3.0"
                             open_position="0.02501155674647538"
                             grasp_position="0.002"
                             max_effort="0.0002"
                             server_timeout="5.0"
                             step_timeout="15.0"/>
          </Sequence>

        </Sequence>
      </Repeat>

    </Sequence>
  </BehaviorTree>
</root>
